  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26024001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "樱……在做什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26024002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "怎么不说话。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26024003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "樱在扮演蘑菇，蘑菇不能说话的哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26024004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "噢噢噢，原来世界上还有这么漂亮可爱的蘑菇的吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26024005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "嘿嘿~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26024006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那我现在要扮演采蘑菇的人，把樱带走咯。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26024007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "顺便问一句，樱这么好看的，会是毒蘑菇吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26024008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "不是的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26024009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "毒蘑菇的话，会伤害到想要靠近樱的人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26024010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "樱就是普通的小蘑菇。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26024011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "知道了，那现在我可以把樱带走了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26024012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "小樱蘑菇，带回去吃要炖汤，还是炒菜呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26024013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "唔~就不能和小樱蘑菇做朋友吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26024014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯，这也是一个好主意，带回一个樱，第二年就能收获几百个小樱了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26024015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "噗~才不会。樱只有一个的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
